<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/><view class="page"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><block wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}"><view class="eyebrow">EVERY GIFT TELLS A STORY</view><view class="heading">把努力，收进自己的故事。</view><view wx:if="{{!signedIn}}" class="card section"><button class="btn" data-url="/pages/account/index" bindtap="go"><image class="feature-entry-icon" src="/images/ui/edit.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>登录查看奖励</text></button></view><block wx:else><view class="card section"><button class="menu-item" data-url="/pages/reward-tasks/index" bindtap="go"><image class="feature-entry-icon" src="/images/ui/gift.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>签到、发帖、活动等多档奖励 ›</text></button><button class="menu-item" data-url="/pages/invite/index" bindtap="go"><image class="feature-entry-icon" src="/images/home/shortcuts/invite.png" mode="aspectFit"/><text>邀请注册阶梯奖励 ›</text></button><button class="menu-item" data-url="/pages/rank-history/index" bindtap="go"><image class="feature-entry-icon" src="/images/home/shortcuts/rank.png" mode="aspectFit"/><text>榜单历史与冻结奖励 ›</text></button><button class="menu-item" data-url="/pages/team/index" bindtap="go"><image class="feature-entry-icon" src="/images/home/shortcuts/team.png" mode="aspectFit"/><text>小队全员任务奖励 ›</text></button><button class="menu-item" data-url="/pages/events/index" bindtap="go"><image class="feature-entry-icon" src="/images/home/shortcuts/events.png" mode="aspectFit"/><text>线下活动奖励 ›</text></button></view><view class="section"><text class="section-title">活动奖励流水</text><view wx:if="{{!rewards.length}}" class="card mt empty">完成活动后，来收下你的奖励。</view><view wx:for="{{rewards}}" wx:key="id" class="card mt"><view class="row"><view class="grow"><view class="title">{{item.name}}</view><text class="caption">{{item.title}} · {{item.tierName}}</text></view><text class="pill">{{statusLabels[item.status] || item.status}}</text></view><text class="caption">领取于 {{item.date}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.end}}" class="caption">权益 {{item.start}} 至 {{item.end}} 00:00</text></view></view><view class="section"><text class="section-title">其他已授予的会员权益</text><view wx:for="{{grants}}" wx:key="id" class="card mt"><view class="title">{{item.title}}</view><text class="caption">{{item.start}} 至 {{item.end}} · {{statusLabels[item.status] || item.status}}</text></view></view><button class="btn soft section" data-url="/pages/membership/index" bindtap="go"><image class="feature-entry-icon" src="/images/ui/member.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>查看全部会员时光 ›</text></button></block></block><view class="footnote">轻动 · 让健康成为一种日常</view></view>
